                    </div>
                    <div class="todo-item" data-href="task-detail.html?status=pending">
                        <div class="icon" style="background-color: #F6FFED;">🟢</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="title">水电验收 <span class="task-tag task">任务</span></div>
                            <div class="desc">水电工作组 | 待执行</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="status pending">待执行</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="todo-item" data-href="task-detail.html?status=pending">
                        <div class="icon" style="background-color: #F6FFED;">🟢</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="title">瓷砖铺贴 <span class="task-tag task">任务</span></div>
